+// Read the TMC2209's own fault flags back over the single-wire UART.
+// Requires the 1k-10k resistor between RX_PIN (A0) and TX_PIN (A1): the
+// driver replies on the same wire it is addressed on, and without that
+// bridge the Arduino can transmit but never listen.  See
